          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramubwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mariya Magadalena aca aja aho abigishwa bari bari uwo mwanya ababwira ati: “Nabonye Umwami!” Aca ababwira ivyo Yesu yamubwiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mugoroba w’uwo musi, ari wo musi wa mbere w’indwi, abigishwa bari bakoraniye hamwe biyugaranye kuko batinya abakuru b’Abayuda. Maze Yesu araza ahagarara hagati muri bo, arababwira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, abereka ibiganza vyiwe n’urubavu rwiwe. Abigishwa baranezerwa cane babonye Umwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
